### This workflow automates sending batched prompts to Claude using the Anthropic API. It submits multiple prompts at once and retrieves the results.

#### How to use

Call this workflow with array of `requests`

```json
{
    "anthropic-version": "2023-06-01",
    "requests": [
        {
            "custom_id": "first-prompt-in-my-batch",
            "params": {
                "max_tokens": 100,
                "messages": [
                    {
                        "content": "Hey Claude, tell me a short fun fact about video games!",
                        "role": "user"
                    }
                ],
                "model": "claude-3-5-haiku-20241022"
            }
        }
    ]
}
```

